                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand Weapon, Options Light Armour (+2 points), Shield (+1 point), javelins (+3 points) An Apuani General may have halberd (+2 points) Special Rules Army General, Warband</characteristic>
